      "comment": "DAINTREE GAV (4) is having his first start around this circuit. Impressive winner latest at Shepparton in a Rank Limit - Grade 5 in quickest time of the program (25.45). Can continue on his winning ways. JUMBUK FUNI (1) is a handy dog who jumped from box 2 last time out and scored by 1.75 lengths at Shepparton (25.64). Has hit winning form and can go on with it. SICILY (2) was in the minors two back (24.78) at Traralgon but ran below best last time at this track, finishing 6th. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings six times from 11 attempts. Great chance to atone. MISS BLACK (8) dominated last start. That form reads well.",
